OL,3,GNEWSARestoration work on historic pier
OL,4,A'astonishing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crumbling historic pier which is
OL,7,Fcurrently undergoing a major
OL,8,Frestoration will reopen next summer, a
OL,9,Fcouncil leader has said.
OL,11,FThe Grade II*-listed Birnbeck Pier, in
OL,12,FWeston-super-Mare, Somerset, closed to
OL,13,Fthe public in 1994 due to safety
OL,14,Fconcerns, and has since been battered
OL,15,Fby storms.
OL,17,FNorth Somerset Council leader Mike Bell
OL,18,Fsaid: "At the moment [we are] 100%
OL,19,Fconfident. We're on time, on budget,
OL,20,Fyou can see the progress they're
OL,21,Fmaking. It's astonishing."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
